{"id":"n81611-1-7","stage":5,"title":"투입 · 投入","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81611-1-7-1","ko":"폐기물을 하수구에 몰래 투입을 한 공장장이 경찰에 붙잡혔대.","zh":"据说把废弃物偷偷排入下水道的工厂厂长被警察抓了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"폐기물을","meaning":"废弃物","explanation":"폐기물：废弃物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"폐기물","audio":"/audio/155f860de148fcfc5f63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83065","senseId":"1","lemma":"폐기물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하수구에","meaning":"下水沟 ，下水道","explanation":"하수구：下水沟 ，下水道；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"하수구","audio":"/audio/7c8608a70ca6af471312.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83959","senseId":"1","lemma":"하수구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰래","meaning":"偷偷地，暗中","explanation":"몰래：偷偷地，暗中","readings":[{"term":"몰래","audio":"/audio/c8aea3f746ec0b30b7d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56016","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"투입을","meaning":"投入，扔进，投掷","explanation":"투입：投入，扔进，投掷；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"투입","audio":"/audio/1d55ba9df83f58523abc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81611","senseId":"1","lemma":"투입","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공장장이","meaning":"厂长","explanation":"공장장：厂长；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공장장","audio":"/audio/b1c4931a38edadaf02cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23857","senseId":"1","lemma":"공장장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경찰에","meaning":"警方，警察当局","explanation":"경찰：警方，警察当局；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"경찰","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25949","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙잡혔대.","meaning":"(人、动物等)被抓住","explanation":"붙잡히다：(人、动物等)被抓住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"붙잡히다","audio":"/audio/8bdcf9dae64d4cee78e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25658","senseId":"2","lemma":"붙잡히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"155f860de148fcfc","term":"폐기물","zh":"废弃物","audio":"/audio/155f860de148fcfc5f63.mp3","entryId":"83065","definition":"无用而丢弃的东西。","pronunciation":["폐ː기물","페ː기물"]},{"id":"7c8608a70ca6af47","term":"하수구","zh":"下水沟 ，下水道","audio":"/audio/7c8608a70ca6af471312.mp3","entryId":"83959","definition":"使雨水或从家庭、工厂等地排出的污水流淌的排水沟。","pronunciation":["하ː수구"]},{"id":"c8aea3f746ec0b30","term":"몰래","zh":"偷偷地，暗中","audio":"/audio/c8aea3f746ec0b30b7d5.mp3","entryId":"56016","definition":"不让人察觉地。","pronunciation":["몰ː래"]},{"id":"1d55ba9df83f5852","term":"투입","zh":"投入，扔进，投掷","audio":"/audio/1d55ba9df83f58523abc.mp3","entryId":"81611","definition":"投进去。","pronunciation":["투입"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b1c4931a38edadaf","term":"공장장","zh":"厂长","audio":"/audio/b1c4931a38edadaf02cb.mp3","entryId":"23857","definition":"负责工厂事务和监督工人的负责人。","pronunciation":["공장장"]},{"id":"642315305ad78197","term":"경찰","zh":"警方，警察当局","audio":"/audio/642315305ad781970c5b.mp3","entryId":"25949","definition":"维持社会秩序、保护人民生命和财产安全；或指负责此事的国家机关。","pronunciation":["경ː찰"]},{"id":"8bdcf9dae64d4cee","term":"붙잡히다","zh":"(人、动物等)被抓住","audio":"/audio/8bdcf9dae64d4cee78e9.mp3","entryId":"25658","definition":"逃跑的对象被捉住。","pronunciation":["붇짜피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff3963ff118fa78ab89f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81611-1-7-2","ko":"그런 이기적인 사람이 다 있나! 오염 물질은 당연히 정화해서 내보내야지.","zh":"怎么会有这么自私的人！污染物当然得经过净化处理后再排放啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이기적인","meaning":"利己的","explanation":"이기적：利己的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"이기적","audio":"/audio/308f1532599851f0f58d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71612","senseId":"1","lemma":"이기적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"连","explanation":"다：连","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"3","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나!","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오염","meaning":"污染","explanation":"오염：污染","readings":[{"term":"오염","audio":"/audio/d12991a2ead44d71b124.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21874","senseId":"1","lemma":"오염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물질은","meaning":"物质","explanation":"물질：物质；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물질","audio":"/audio/e082ce61e96727adef6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15742","senseId":"3","lemma":"물질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당연히","meaning":"当然","explanation":"당연히：当然","readings":[{"term":"당연히","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49497","senseId":"1","lemma":"당연히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정화해서","meaning":"净化","explanation":"정화하다：净化；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"정화하다","audio":"/audio/305db9d109864cd32cc3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75451","senseId":"1","lemma":"정화하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내보내야지.","meaning":"排放","explanation":"내보내다：排放；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내보내다","audio":"/audio/c2c51426c0ebeeb8f180.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28428","senseId":"2","lemma":"내보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"308f1532599851f0","term":"이기적","zh":"利己的","audio":"/audio/308f1532599851f0f58d.mp3","entryId":"71612","definition":"只顾自己利益的。","pronunciation":["이ː기적"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"连","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"表示“出乎意料地”，含有轻微惊讶、感叹、嘲讽等意思。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"d12991a2ead44d71","term":"오염","zh":"污染","audio":"/audio/d12991a2ead44d71b124.mp3","entryId":"21874","definition":"成为肮脏的状态。","pronunciation":["오ː염"]},{"id":"e082ce61e96727ad","term":"물질","zh":"物质","audio":"/audio/e082ce61e96727adef6d.mp3","entryId":"15742","definition":"占有空间的一部分，具有质量的因素。","pronunciation":["물찔"]},{"id":"0efb3081ed85ab14","term":"당연히","zh":"当然","audio":"/audio/0efb3081ed85ab147e84.mp3","entryId":"49497","definition":"按道理应当是那样。","pronunciation":["당연히"]},{"id":"305db9d109864cd3","term":"정화하다","zh":"净化","audio":"/audio/305db9d109864cd32cc3.mp3","entryId":"75451","definition":"将脏东西或不纯净的东西变干净。","pronunciation":["정화하다"]},{"id":"c2c51426c0ebeeb8","term":"내보내다","zh":"排放","audio":"/audio/c2c51426c0ebeeb8f180.mp3","entryId":"28428","definition":"丢弃或排到外面。","pronunciation":["내ː보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/64aaa53759b4f1ab6418.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.296,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81611","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":178,"sequenceScore":6.1227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么会有这么自私的人！污染物当然得经过净化处理后再排放啊。","据说把废弃物偷偷排入下水道的工厂厂长被警察抓了。","沿着海岸线有好多哨所呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说把废弃物偷偷排入下水道的工厂厂长被警察抓了。","沿着海岸线有好多哨所呢。","怎么会有这么自私的人！污染物当然得经过净化处理后再排放啊。"],"answer":2}]}
